# Mizline Overview

Cloud-based QR ordering and kitchen management SaaS for coffee shops, cafés, bakeries, and small restaurants. Multi-tenant architecture.

## Applications

| App | Audience | Priority |
|-----|----------|----------|
| Customer PWA | Table guests (QR scan) | Mobile-first, no auth |
| KDS (Staff) | Kitchen staff + store managers | Desktop-first, `/{path}/kitchen` KDS + `/{path}/admin` management |

## Stack

- **Frontend**: Next.js, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, shadcn/ui
- **Backend**: NestJS, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Redis, BullMQ, Socket.IO
- **Infra**: Docker, Coolify (initial), GitHub Actions CI/CD

## Principles

- Simplicity and maintainability over premature optimization
- Real-time updates under 1 second
- TypeScript across the entire stack
- Horizontal scalability; Kubernetes-ready

## Out of Scope (MVP)

Payment (Stripe/Apple Pay), loyalty, coupons, customer accounts, inventory, scheduling. See `future-features.mdc`.
